      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "A technical case study in procedural PBR materials and lifelike environments"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A technical case study focused on authoring a procedural PBR material library and building a \"lifelike environment\" using modern AAA workflows."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "All assets and materials in this study were created entirely from scratch by me. This project demonstrates the complete environment art pipeline, from procedural texturing to modular asset creation."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "– Materials: Authored a 100% procedural PBR material library (plaster, cobblestone, brick) in Substance Designer."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "– Assets: Responsible for the entire asset pipeline: high-poly sculpting (ZBrush), modeling (Maya), baking, and texturing."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "* Developed with professional feedback and guidance from Sarah Swenson (Senior Environment Artist, Naughty Dog)."
        },
